# A committed TEMPLATE of .github/c2-serving-job.env (scripts/ci/c2_serving_job.py parses it) for tonight's four-card window.
# E4: G1 as production would serve it at hand-back if G1 is chosen: general-prefix-tp4 (8 seats, prefix reuse on) on the same
# smoke and coding-text tests as E1 (S2 today), E3 (general-tp4) and T1 (S2 + caps). The G1 path is the same in every image.
# Duration (estimate): 15-20 min.
C2_CARDS=quad
C2_ACTIONS=reset smoke
C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-serve-3
C2_PROFILE=general-prefix-tp4
C2_SMOKE_TESTS=warmup,coding,long_real_text,concurrent4,concurrent4_steady,concurrent4_code,concurrent4_code_equal
